@startuml
title Activity 15 - Finance Officer Invoice Approval

|Treasury/Finance Officer|
start
:Open Finance module;
|Frontend|
:Check role and Finance department;
if (Finance access allowed?) then (yes)
  :Load pending supplier invoices;
  |Backend|
  :Read protected supplier-finance records;
  |Treasury/Finance Officer|
  :Open invoice details;
  :Compare invoice with PO and completed GRN;
  :Check supplier, tax, amount and attachment;
  :Choose Approve or Reject;
  if (Reject?) then (yes)
    :Enter rejection reason;
    |Backend|
    :Set invoice status = REJECTED;
    :Save review history;
    :Notify supplier;
    stop
  else (Approve)
    |Backend|
    :Set invoice status = APPROVED;
    :Create payment status = PENDING_PAYMENT;
    :Notify Payment Team;
    :Notify supplier;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Hide Finance menu and invoice cards;
  :Redirect to Overview;
  stop
endif
@enduml
